─ Keyboard shortcuts ───────────────────────

  Compose
  /                     Commands
  @                     Mention files and
                        plugins
  $                     Select a skill
  Enter                 Send message
  Shift+Enter / Ctrl+J  New line
  Ctrl+R                Search input
                        history
  ctrl+v                Attach clipboard
                        image

  Session
  ?          Keyboard shortcuts

  ↑/↓ scroll · Esc to close
